            "review_title": "Review at Bo Beo Pho Ga Xua",
            "review_text": "laurent M\nAmboise, France160 contributions\n0\nGreat Vietnamese cuisine... and with a smile!\nMar 2024 • Couples\nSmall family Vietnamese restaurant where they prepare excellent local dishes, with fresh and tasty ingredients. We made it our canteen during the 2 1/2 days spent in this beautiful city of Hanoi.\nAnd to make matters worse, they are very kind! It almost feels like family. I love this place and I highly recommend it so that you avoid the soulless tourist restaurants in the area...\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten March 19, 2024",
