            "review_title": "Review at Bo Beo Pho Ga Xua",
            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6958 contributions\n0\nRecommended.\nOct 2022\nGreat family owned restaurant, son and parents, proving good food and nourishment to tired, and drunk, travellers who step in for a bite to eat and a rest.\n\nAs can be seen from the photos, the portions were quite big, lots of meat and veg to fry, and beer to complement the feast, and it WAS a feast, I was full after it all. \n\nGood, clean, well cooked food, in friendly environment, in the centre of the main drag.\n\nGood spot for some good food in between all the drinking and sport outside. \nRecommended. \nGood value too for about 18 Euros.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 24, 2022",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
